docs {
Aktivitas publik terbaru by username (tanpa auth). Rate 100/menit per IP.

Mode merge (tanpa query `kind`): satu respons, max 20 item, tanpa kursor.
Digabung dari: kontribusi approved/corrected, komentar published,
verifikasi selesai, vote (word/comment, kata masih published).

Mode terfilter (`kind` + `limit` + `cursor`): pagination keyset ULID,
respons include `meta` (next_cursor, has_more).

200 sukses (mode merge):

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "contribution",
            "occurred_at": "2026-09-20T10:00:00.000Z",
            "word_id": "01JD...",
            "lemma": "makatn",
            "summary": "Kata: makatn"
          },
          {
            "kind": "vote",
            "occurred_at": "2026-09-20T09:00:00.000Z",
            "word_id": "01JD...",
            "lemma": "kumis",
            "summary": "\"kumis\" perlu dicek ulang"
          }
        ]
      }
    }

200 sukses (mode terfilter `?kind=comment&limit=20`):

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "items": [
          { "id": "...", "kind": "comment", "occurred_at": "...", "word_id": "...", "lemma": "...", "summary": "..." }
        ]
      },
      "meta": { "limit": 20, "next_cursor": "01JD...", "has_more": true }
    }

404 USER_NOT_FOUND sama seperti profil publik.
Vote hanya word/comment ber-lemma; bookmark, usulan pending, email, phone, user id tetap tidak tampil.
Arah vote dibaca dari akhiran summary ("perlu dicek ulang" = downvote).
} meta {
  name: Get Public Activity
  seq: 4
}
get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{username}}/activity?kind=comment&limit=20
  body: none
  auth: none
}
tests {
  test("200 + items aktivitas publik", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.items).to.be.an('array');
    expect(res.body.data.items.length).to.be.at.most(20);
    if (res.body.data.items.length > 0) {
      const item = res.body.data.items[0];
      expect(['contribution', 'comment', 'verification', 'vote']).to.include(
        item.kind,
      );
      expect(item.occurred_at).to.be.a('string');
      expect(item.summary).to.be.a('string');
      expect(item).to.not.have.property('user_id');
      expect(item).to.not.have.property('email');
    }
  });
  test("200 + meta cursor when filtered", () => {
    expect(res.body.meta).to.exist;
    expect(res.body.meta.limit).to.equal(20);
    expect(res.body.meta.has_more).to.be.a('boolean');
    expect(res.body.meta.next_cursor).to.be.a('string').or.be.null;
  });
}